{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794669383864,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effeHQ7tMXhYT9pQMI","part":{"partID":"prt_1daa18e4b001bn6OdjV3xa6EPp","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effeHQ7tMXhYT9pQMI","messageID":"msg_1daa18218001tqmWzMaHxWDKzy","type":"tool","id":"call_e10df4388dae4ab281a0cec2","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"offset":1187,"limit":220,"path":".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml"},"output":"Read file .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml, lines 1187-1406\n1187:       step_dispatch_iteration:\n1188:         action: \"Dispatch @deep-review agent for one review iteration\"\n1189:         resolve_executor:\n1190:           source: \"config.executor\"\n1191:           loader: \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts#parseExecutorConfig\"\n1192:         pre_dispatch:\n1193:           generate_summary: |\n1194:             STATE SUMMARY (auto-generated):\n1195:             Iteration: {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n1196:             Dimension: {next_dimension}\n1197:             Prior Findings: P0={p0_count} P1={p1_count} P2={p2_count}\n1198:             Dimension Coverage: {dimensions_covered_list} ({dimension_coverage})\n1199:             Traceability: core={core_protocol_status} overlay={overlay_protocol_status}\n1200:             {resource_map_prompt_line}\n1201:             Coverage Age: {coverage_age}\n1202:             Last 2 ratios: {ratio_prev} -> {ratio_latest}\n1203:             Stuck count: {stuck_count}\n1204:             Provisional Verdict: {PASS|CONDITIONAL|FAIL|PENDING} hasAdvisories={has_advisories}\n1205:           render_prompt_pack:\n1206:             template_path: \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl\"\n1207:             renderer: \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/prompt-pack.ts#renderPromptPack\"\n1208:             output_path: \"{state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md