 as improvised', () => {\n2184:  it('counts a shell read of the owner entry document as a skill load', () => {\n2199:  it('counts a shell read of the command document as a command load', () => {\n2241:  it('still counts a read after a heredoc ends', () => {\n2269:  it('reads the packet a mode shares with another mode as the skill path', () => {\n2285:  it('matches every mode packet folder a mode registry names', () => {\n2321:  it('returns asked for an ask row that reported the offer and wrote nothing', () => {\n2336:  it('returns asked for an ask row that ended on a question naming the command', () => {\n2357:  it('returns asked when the command ends a sentence before the question', () => {\n2378:  it('reads a question on a start row as no workflow path', () => {\n2399:  it('reads an ask row that named no command as no workflow path', () => {\n2413:  it('reads an empty ask row as no workflow path', () => {\n2424:  it('reads a question followed by a write as improvised', () => {\n2446:  it('returns asked for an ask row whose only write is outside the checkout', () => {\n2469:  it('reads a command document read before the question as the command path', () => {\n2491:  it('does not call a run improvised for a write outside the checkout alone', () => {\n2505:  it('reads an absolute path inside the checkout as a write', () => {\n2520:  it('keeps a home path as a write when the line names no checkout', () => {\n2534:  it('does not read a temp-file write as the first write', () => {\n2551:  it('does not read a home scratch write outside the named checkout as the first write', () => {\n2568:  it('falls back to the temp folders when the line names no checkout', () => {\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"177:describe('normalize', () => {\n192:  it('reads the cmd key of a Codex exec_command call', () => {\n205:  it('counts a shell step that redirects into a file as a write', () => {\n216:  it('leaves a redirect inside a quoted argument as a shell step', () => {\n225:  it('records the command Claude Code expanded into the user turn', () => {\n232:  it('records no expanded command for a runtime that keeps no command tag', () => {\n238:  it('reads the commands of a Codex exec body as one shell step', () => {\n247:  it('reads a redirect inside a Codex exec body as a write', () => {\n257:  it('keeps a Codex exec body that runs no shell command as a step with no command', () => {\n268:  it('reads every string of a Codex exec body whose commands sit in a list', () => {\n281:describe('commandLines', () => {\n282:  it('reports no line when the reply names no command', () => {\n288:  it('reports one line with the state it carried', () => {\n298:  it('reports one line when the name and the state word sit inside backticks', () => {\n306:  it('reports one line when the name and the state word sit inside square brackets', () => {\n316:  it('reports no line when the state word is outside the three', () => {\n322:  it('reports two lines at one line each when they name different commands', () => {\n336:  it('reports two lines that name one command twice as a count of two', () => {\n349:describe('offerSeenIn', () => {\n352:  it('reads a declined line as an offer the turn saw', () => {\n362:  it('reads no offer when the line named another command', () => {\n373:describe('followedBeforeWrite', () => {\n374:  it('passes a run that read the command document before its first write', () => {\n386:  it('fails a run whose document read came after the write', () => {\n400:  it('fails a run that only read the confirm workflow after writing', () => {\n415:  it('fails a late confirm read for the renamed skill command', () => {\n425:  it('passes a run that loaded the command through the skill tool before writing', () => {\n438:  it('passes a run that read the document and never wrote', () => {\n453:  it('does not read another command through a prompt mirror', () => {\n461:  it(