":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-4/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-4/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -122,10 +122,13 @@\n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n-- Dimension: security - Focus area: the capture's fit/decline rows and the live holdout guard - Reason: the fit tally is the new measurement for refusals and questions, and the brief asks whether those rows can still carry or start a mutating command; the holdout guard must be checked against the live capture, not only the committed baseline - Rotation status: correctness complete; security next - Required evidence: `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:560-700`, `command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:149-267`, `command-routing-baseline.json:1961-1984` Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n-\n+- Dimension: security\n+- Focus area: the capture's fit/decline rows and the live holdout guard\n+- Reason: the fit tally is the new measurement for refusals and questions, and the brief asks whether those rows can still carry or start a mutating command; the holdout guard must be checked against the live capture, not only the committed baseline\n+- Rotation status: correctness complete; security next\n+- Required evidence: `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:560-700`, `command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:149-267`, `command-routing-baseline.json:1961-1984`\n <!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n \n ---\n \n","status":"modified","additions":5,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"conten