{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794670855884,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effeHQ7tMXhYT9pQMI","part":{"partID":"prt_1dab7fc6f001H5wVTCpD1JWi4T","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effeHQ7tMXhYT9pQMI","messageID":"msg_1dab7ec74001oRY6LzdVLskqgZ","type":"tool","id":"call_4ab473125318457694cb4e99","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: traceability\n- Focus area: whether the new fit/stage counts are held to the committed baseline, and whether the README's new claims match the code\n- Reason: the safety counts are now reported but not ratcheted; the README's `offeredAs` claim already disagrees with both writers (iteration 1), so the remaining docs and the attached-metrics block need a baseline check\n- Rotation status: correctness and security complete; traceability next\n- Required evidence: `command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:149-282`, `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:726-776`, `README.md:118-123,187`\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->","oldString":"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: traceability - Focus area: whether the new fit/stage counts are held to the committed baseline, and whether the README's new claims match the code - Reason: the safety counts are now reported but not ratcheted; the README's `offeredAs` claim already disagrees with both writers (iteration 1), so the remaining docs and the attached-metrics block need a baseline check - Rotation status: correctness and security complete; traceability next - Required evidence: `command-routing-slice.vitest.ts:149-282`, `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs:726-776`, `README.md:118-123,187` Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-4/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-4/deep-